    "title": "Studio West 117 Fieldhouse in Lakewood closing soon - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By 19 News Digital Team ,\n14 hours ago LAKEWOOD, Ohio (WOIO) - The Studio West 117 Fieldhouse in Lakewood is closing its doors after three years serving the LGBTQ+ community. The owners recently announced the closure, slated for Dec. 28, on social media but did not say why. The space hosted sports leagues, performances, restaurants and community fairs. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
